# Hitomezashi missing pixel fix

- Source URL: https://github.com/projf/projf-explore/issues/172

At the price of one extra flipflop (**last_h_stitch0**) I extended h-line by one pixel.
Code is in verilog due to the the fact that I use ISE with basys2 to play with VGA :)
```
	//-------------------------------------------------------------
	// paint stitch pattern with 16x16 pixel grid
	wire stitch;
	wire v_line, v_on;
	wire h_line, h_on;
	reg last_h_stitch0;
	
	assign v_line = (sx[3:0] == 4'b0000);
	assign h_line = (sy[3:0] == 4'b0000);
	assign v_on = sy[4] ^ v_start[sx[9:4]];
	assign h_on = sx[4] ^ h_start[sy[8:4]];
	assign stitch = (v_line && v_on) || (h_line && h_on) || last_h_stitch0;

        always @ ( posedge clk ) begin
		last_h_stitch0 <= h_line && h_on;
	end

```
